# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository, regardless of the
# committer's OS or local core.autocrlf setting. Matches Prettier's
# "endOfLine": "lf" (.prettierrc.json), so formatting and git diffs agree —
# without this, Windows checkouts with autocrlf=true silently convert
# committed LF files to CRLF, which then shows as a full-file diff the next
# time anyone touches them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
